                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Bowen to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Caracas</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-06-29"><hi rendition="#italic">June 29,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Bowen reports that he has been notified that the Orinoco River, Guiria, Caño
                    Colorado, and Vela de Coro are declared blockaded, but that he doubts the
                    efficiency of the blockade. * * *)</p>
            </div>
